{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02154",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.33,
      "end_seconds": 5.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.59,
      "text": "Afternoon, thanks for coming in. What do you need help with?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 7.88,
      "end_seconds": 14.1,
      "duration_seconds": 6.22,
      "text": "It's a bone sticking out of my lower leg, mostly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.2,
      "end_seconds": 17.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.09,
      "end_seconds": 22.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "I've had it for about four days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.73,
      "end_seconds": 24.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "Okay, go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.8,
      "end_seconds": 42.81,
      "duration_seconds": 18.01,
      "text": "I've also had heavy bleeding, for four weeks. I've, I've also had numbness in the foot, since yesterday. With numbness in the foot, a four out of ten, I suppose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.66,
      "end_seconds": 52.19,
      "duration_seconds": 8.53,
      "text": "Have you had a bone sticking out of your lower leg before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.32,
      "end_seconds": 61.4,
      "duration_seconds": 8.08,
      "text": "I, I had a similar thing a couple of years ago. It went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.88,
      "end_seconds": 76.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.97,
      "end_seconds": 86.55,
      "duration_seconds": 8.58,
      "text": "Years back I got a rash from naproxen, so I stay away from it now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.19,
      "end_seconds": 91.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.4,
      "end_seconds": 101.69,
      "duration_seconds": 8.29,
      "text": "Erm, I've got heart disease. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.57,
      "end_seconds": 110.81,
      "duration_seconds": 8.24,
      "text": "Yes, heart disease is known to us, good to have that clear. Right, have you been to theatre before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.0,
      "end_seconds": 118.78,
      "duration_seconds": 6.78,
      "text": "Yeah, yes, I had part of my thyroid removed, years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.97,
      "end_seconds": 131.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "Any inherited conditions that you know of in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.74,
      "end_seconds": 136.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Actually, my mother has an underactive thyroid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.76,
      "end_seconds": 140.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Is there any regular medication you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.1,
      "end_seconds": 144.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Nothing regular, you know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.18,
      "end_seconds": 162.24,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.99,
      "end_seconds": 177.82,
      "duration_seconds": 14.83,
      "text": "I've never touched a cigarette. I only drink at family occasions. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.74,
      "end_seconds": 180.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Any sign of chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.15,
      "end_seconds": 188.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "Uh, I haven't noticed any chest pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.26,
      "end_seconds": 195.67,
      "duration_seconds": 6.41,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any loss of consciousness or head injury?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 197.65,
      "end_seconds": 201.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "Erm, um, none of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.79,
      "end_seconds": 206.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Anything different when you pass water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.99,
      "end_seconds": 211.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Actually, no, that's all fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 213.17,
      "end_seconds": 223.84,
      "duration_seconds": 10.67,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Blood pressure 120 over 70, pulse is 114 beats a minute. Oxygen saturation is 96 percent, temperature is 36.9 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.76,
      "end_seconds": 226.46,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.31,
      "end_seconds": 231.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.91,
      "end_seconds": 234.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.7,
      "end_seconds": 238.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.98,
      "end_seconds": 261.98,
      "duration_seconds": 7.0,
      "text": "There is a wound with bone visible and the foot is cool with no pulse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.93,
      "end_seconds": 299.29,
      "duration_seconds": 31.36,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again. Okay, thinking it through, I'd lean towards an open fracture with a compromised blood supply. I'm going to order blood tests, for pre-operative. What I'm giving you is co-amoxiclav, 1.2 grams, now, single dose. That should help with open fracture. Keep still, I am splinting the leg and sending you to theatre now. The orthopaedic team would be the right next step, I'll refer you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 301.37,
      "end_seconds": 302.07,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.32,
      "end_seconds": 319.78,
      "duration_seconds": 16.46,
      "text": "I'm not ordering an urgent X-ray today. If things carry on in a month, we'll consider it. Come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse. Let's review you straight away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 320.54,
      "end_seconds": 323.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "I, I can manage that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.96,
      "end_seconds": 329.49,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 330.43,
      "end_seconds": 334.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "Right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 335.96,
      "end_seconds": 337.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
}